       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Don't assume a psychiatric cause or intoxication,"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " even with a known psychiatric diagnosis or an odor of alcohol."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
